E021_invalid_switch_selector.cmm:3:13: semantic error: switch selector must be int or string, got float
  |
3 |     switch (1.5) {
  |             ^
what went wrong:
  The value in 'switch (...)' must be an int or string, but got float.
how to fix:
  Switch on an integer or text value, or use 'if'/'else' for other types.
      switch (x) {
            case 1: {}
            default: {}
      }
